'''にゃんこ大暴走''' (''lit.'' '''Nyanko Great Runaway''') was a spin-off of [[Nyanko Daisensou]]. Developed by DeNA Co Ltd and [[PONOS Corporation|PONOS]]. PONOS ended support for this game as of November 28th, 2014, meaning that it can no longer be played.

